  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2db849c8-faf5-4019-808e-0fe6b3c5d529"],
 ", is not degenerate, so the model is not of Hodge type:"
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"78e3037f-c0fa-4c8d-9437-a29bab5d2697"],

